384]烛光里的奶妈[/uid] (2026-08-28 11:13):[/b]<br/><br/>我现在在看互金看织布机[s:a2:哦嗬嗬嗬]狼大有没有券盒指点一下，个股是真的选不来[/quote]<br/>这个方向我更多的是赌 是尝试 没有任何确定性。", "lou": 585, "content_length": 47, "reply_to": 879885678, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787886836}, {"pid": 879886346, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 63, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 11:17", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879886147,47288722,1681]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=64786164]XX的小迷弟[/uid] (2026-08-28 11:16):[/b]<br/><br/>那今天能抄点吗？能不能吃顿KFC[/quote]<br/>你们随意啊  不用管我的  我又不能控制你们的钱<br/>但是他们说今天指数有风险我目前确实看不到<br/>明确说明<br/>今天收盘最差就是个十字星。", "lou": 586, "content_length": 119, "reply_to": 879886147, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787887075}, {"pid": 879887065, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 65, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 11:22", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879886663,47288722,1681]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=6313142]暮残[/uid] (2026-08-28 11:20):[/b]<br/><br/>早上跟了隔壁指导的车小仓位去了东方跟南方航空<br/>这织布机给我看困了[/quote]<br/>做过了科技  再去这种红利 呆不下去的  <br/>一个月波动不够科技一天的  甚至不如逆回购", "lou": 587, "content_length": 75, "reply_to": 879886663, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787887344}, {"pid": 879887226, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 55, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 11:23", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879886801,47288722,1681]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67143809]Rzzz二号机[/uid] (2026-08-28 11:20):[/b]<br/><br/>[s:pg:转身]所以今天收盘大概有多少仓位&amp;#160; 60&amp;#160; 70？[/quote]<br/>收盘就是65%-60%<br/>这里万一指数突破诱多呢<br/>所以仓位还是不能太低的。<br/>但是买什么票就不一样了。", "lou": 588, "content_length": 90, "reply_to": 879886801, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787887413}, {"pid": 879887649, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 59, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 11:26", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879887470,47288722,1682]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67157410]c471167449[/uid] (2026-08-28 11:25):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大这个预判还是太NB了，昨天精准卖在科技最高点。。。[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>呐 你这就是捧杀了  我是早上高点卖的   但是科技最高点是尾盘 和今天冲高<br/>我没有卖到那个点。", "lou": 589, "content_length": 85, "reply_to": 879887470, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787887587}, {"pid": 879888507, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 108, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 11:32", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "早盘看来  科技抄底的散单子开始变多了 <br/>感觉每-1%都有很多钱在买各种科技。<br/>应该就是所谓的回调后买入吧<br/>如果到一定阶段，这里如果反弹一波不过高点的反弹，这些资金不会卖 反而会追仓。<br/>我猜这是大概率事件", "lou": 590, "content_length": 185, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787887925}, {"pid": 879899952, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 40, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 13:16", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879899828,47288722,1688]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=26853624]姆了个Q的[/uid] (2026-08-28 13:15):[/b]<br/><br/>猛拉材料啊，红星、玻纤[/quote]<br/>其实是化工类", "lou": 591, "content_length": 17, "reply_to": 879899828, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787894187}, {"pid": 879900310, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 53, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 13:19", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879900124,47288722,1689]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67138111]Altyport[/uid] (2026-08-28 13:18):[/b]<br/><br/>现在显然是金融更好，向往上顶只能靠金融了，科技废了，科技起来也是跟着指数顶上去诱多的，指数想上去就一定得靠金融[/quote]<br/>好也没用  没波动  就很难吃到差价", "lou": 592, "content_length": 33, "reply_to": 879900124, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787894391}, {"pid": 879900529, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 61, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 13:22", "subject": "", "alterinfo"